OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn 1981 the iconic painting,
OL,13,     GGuernica, was finally handed to
OL,14,     GSpain after a 44-year exile.
OL,15,     GPablo Picasso created the artwork
OL,16,     Gafter the town was bombed in the
OL,17,     GSpanish civil war.
